warning[unclosed_resource]: `builder` is opened by `append` but nothing closes it
  --> tests/lint/unclosed_resource/bad.jai:6:5
   |
 6 |     append(*builder, "total: ");
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: close it when done, for example with a `defer` right after opening
   = note: `unclosed_resource` is `warn` by default

warning[unclosed_resource]: `file` is opened by `file_open` but nothing closes it
  --> tests/lint/unclosed_resource/bad.jai:11:17
   |
11 |     file, ok := file_open(path);
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: close it when done, for example with a `defer` right after opening
   = note: `unclosed_resource` is `warn` by default

warning[unclosed_resource]: `builder` is opened by `init_string_builder` but nothing closes it
  --> tests/lint/unclosed_resource/bad.jai:19:5
   |
19 |     init_string_builder(*builder);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: close it when done, for example with a `defer` right after opening
